cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Moscow Parking Occupancy Dataset"
abstract: >-
  5.17 million half-hourly occupancy observations for 213 municipal car parks in Moscow, continuous since 31 March 2025 and refreshed weekly. Long, dense, public parking-occupancy series are rare: most published work on occupancy prediction still relies on the UCI Parking Birmingham set, which covers three months of 2016. Collected from publicly accessible Moscow Department of Transport parking data; known data quirks are documented rather than cleaned away.
authors:
